				    #"dpegpl-hseq-dev_Database" = Origine{[Name=database,Kind="Database"]}[Data],
				    hseq4all_gl_gld_Schema = #"dpegpl-hseq-dev_Database"{[Name=schema,Kind="Schema"]}[Data],
				    finding_View = hseq4all_gl_gld_Schema{[Name="question",Kind="View"]}[Data]
				 
				in finding_View
				```

